# Conductor's per-worktree agent scratch dir. Conductor also excludes this via
# .git/info/exclude, but that file is local-only and absent from a plain clone —
# so the rule lives here too. Holds the /ui-check fixture project (videos,
# workbook, manifests, screenshots) alongside agent notes.
.context/
.venv/
node_modules/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills
*.html
*.gif
*.png
*.csv
*.app/

